{title: Mahk jchi}
{subtitle: Tutelo/Saponi}

Mahk jchi tahm buooi yahmpi gidi
Mahk jchi taum buooi kan spewa ebi (rpt lines)
Mahmpi wah hoka yee monk
Tahond tani kiyee tiyee
Gee we-me eetiyee
Nanka yaht yamoonieah wajitse (rpt)

Hey ah hey ah hey ah...

{ci: With Beauty in our Hearts}
{ci: With Beauty in our Minds (rpt lines)}
{ci: Oh our Ancestors come,}
{ci: Give us strength to stand, to sing and dance}
{ci: And to never forget}
{ci: Who we are and where we are coming from (rpt line)}
